  "description": "Unofficial C# (netstandard2.0) port of sqlparser-rs, the extensible SQL lexer and parser of the Apache DataFusion project. Tokenizer, parser and AST for 16 SQL dialects (generic, ANSI, PostgreSQL, MySQL, MS SQL Server, SQLite, Snowflake, BigQuery, ClickHouse, DuckDB, Databricks, Hive, Redshift, Spark SQL, Oracle, Teradata), SQL generation with pretty printing, visitors, rewriting and syntactic analysis. Runs on .NET Framework 4.8 and .NET 8/10 without native dependencies. Contains LeptonTech.SqlParser.Core.dll (faithful port, sqlparser-rs commit dacdbc9) and LeptonTech.SqlParser.dll (public API). Not affiliated with or endorsed by The Apache Software Foundation.",
